# The portable core: the files of src/ that every host compiles (PostgreSQL, SQLite, ...). They include the C library,
# compiler intrinsics, col/*.h headers of this list and core/host.h, and nothing else: scripts/check-portable.sh enforces it
# (CI, both jobs), sqlite/Makefile builds the .c files of this list into the SQLite extension. Add a file here when it
# needs no host API beyond src/core/host.h; a file that needs more belongs to a host (src/ for PostgreSQL, sqlite/).
#
